# KN-012: Warming accelerates acid decomposition of thiosulfate
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL @ 20C
add v1 HCl 0.004mol
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL @ 40C
add v2 HCl 0.004mol
add v2 Na2S2O3 0.001mol
wait 10s
inspect
